= The Southern Expedition

After defeating Chen Jiongming, we are only one last step from unifying Guangdong. Warlord Deng Benyin and his coalition of southern warlords in Beihai and Hainan is still running rampant in the south and resisting our control.

Now, our final job for the NRA is to crush this menace once and for all.

